<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP says WiNZ fund allotment price NZ$1.09/unit.</title>
<headline>AMP says WiNZ fund allotment price NZ$1.09/unit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMP Investments said on Wednesday 133,316,858 units in the WiNZ Fund had been allotted in the initial offer at a price of NZ$1.099903 per unit.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 4714 272</p>
<p>e-mail wellington.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
